; === PURGE HOTEND - COREXY SYSTEM ===
M291 P"Purge started..." R"Purging material" S1 T2 ; Display message

M104 S200 ; Start heating hotend to 200°C
M109 S200 ; Wait until hotend reaches 200°C

G28                         ; Home all axes

G91                         ; Relative positioning
G1 Z10 F3000                ; Move Z up 10 mm to avoid collision
G90                         ; Absolute positioning

G1 X5 Y70 Z0.3 F5000        ; Move to purge start position
G1 Z0.3 F1000               ; Set safe print height

G1 X5 Y220 F1500 E15        ; Extrude 15 mm along Y axis (first line)
G1 X5.2 Y220 Z0.3 F5000     ; Slight lateral move
G1 X5.2 Y70 Z0.3 F1500 E30  ; Extrude 30 mm back along Y axis (second line)

G1 E-1 F2000                ; Retract 1 mm to prevent oozing (optional)

G1 Z10 F3000                ; Raise Z
G1 X122 Y220 F6000          ; Move to bed center (adjust if needed)

M291 P"Purge finished." R"Purge macro" S1 T2 ; Final message